Pocket Print — first hardware session, 2026-10-14
Printer: LX-D02 (advertises as "LX-D02"), reported MAC a2ff00000098
Host: Chrome on Android, page served from https://print.otelo2.com

Kept verbatim as evidence for PROTOCOL.md §4. Note that the repeated
"status: battery N%" lines are the printer's own 5A 02 heartbeat arriving
unprompted every ~2 seconds, not something we ask for.

