Outcome: all three printed. The paper also showed a bug the log could not:
the text job clipped "This printer makes a lovely racket." at "rack", because
the renderer drew fixed-size lines and never measured them against the page
(measured: 421 px of text into 372 px of printable width). Fixed and wrapped.
